cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the PACE-LS research artifact."
title: "PACE-LS-CVRP-FPGA"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Kumral"
    given-names: "Cem Deniz"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22058605"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cemkumrall/PACE-LS-CVRP-FPGA"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  Research artifact accompanying the study "PACE-LS: A profiling-guided
  CPU–FPGA architecture for concurrent execution of CVRP local search".
  The repository contains CPU optimization and profiling code, a scope-matched
  C++ golden reference, FPGA HLS sources, design-space exploration results,
  post-implementation reports, physical ZedBoard/ILA validation artifacts,
  and final experimental result data.
keywords:
  - "CPU–FPGA co-design"
  - "FPGA acceleration"
  - "CVRP"
  - "local search"
  - "profiling-guided acceleration"
  - "design-space exploration"
  - "Vitis HLS"
